recommend keep-going the dead-zone trilogy is closed (pass · shift · pin); the loop names its own next Lotus crux — the booked DC blocker that removes the offset the rectifiers and the 1-bit crush introduce, a hysteresis comparator that gives this rung a memory against chatter, or a fresh DSP family — as its own self-approved design round
